file: configparams.cpp
test: editorStringWritesThroughToConfig
why: the real bug. maxLen 0 means no limit, and truncating unconditionally
     emptied every shipped string parameter -- this guards the fix
--- from
            if (p.maxLen > 0) {
                param.truncate(p.maxLen);
            }
--- to
            param.truncate(p.maxLen);
